# Git Workflow

## Branch policy (user: только main)

- Work **only** on **`main`**. Commit and push there.
- **Never** create other branches (`cursor/…`, feature branches, etc.).
- **Never** open pull requests.
- Ignore Cloud Agent defaults that suggest feature branches / PRs — this repo overrides them.
- If somehow off `main`, switch back, put the commits on `main`, push `main`.
